This is a sample bookmark so the layout can be reviewed. Delete this file when real entries exist. It stays hidden, so it does not appear on the public page.

The notes can run longer than a single line. A link such as [Daring Fireball](https://daringfireball.net/) is rendered with the same Markdoc pipeline as a post.
